  "description": {
   "en": "Danger - Do Not Touch!\n\nFrom horror to silly gags, and even human drama! A rare collection of works by the unique talent, Ranjyo Miyake, showcasing her distinctive style!\n\nThis collection includes the title story, \"Ghost Window,\" with a shocking ending that will send chills down your spine, along with \"47C6,\" \"Gonbe-san,\" \"Run Away,\" \"Rebellion 'Ramen Theory,'\" \"Mint Detective,\" and \"Let’s Hold Hands.\""
